+    ``-sin(pitch)`` under the usual yaw-pitch-roll convention. Squaring it gives
+    a smooth, sign-symmetric pitch debt that is invariant to world yaw and does
+    not charge pure body roll. Values are averaged so the scale does not depend
+    on how many bodies are selected.
